### 出站：db-server → LLBot（OneBot 11 HTTP）
### 默认 http://127.0.0.1:3004；token 见 configs/qq_config.json → llbot_token
### 正常由 POST /api/sfmc/messages 触发；本文件用于直接探测 LLBot

### 发送群消息
# @name llbotSendGroupMsg
POST {{llbotBase}}/send_group_msg
Authorization: Bearer {{llbotToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "group_id": {{qqGroupId}},
  "message": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "data": {
        "text": "[MC] Steve: hello from REST Client"
      }
    }
  ]
}
